{number: 140}
{title: I Need Thee Every Hour}
{key: C}

{start_of_verse: 1}
I need Thee every hour,
Most gracious Lord;
No tender voice like Thine
Can peace afford.
I need Thee, O I need Thee;
Every hour I need Thee;
O bless me now, my Saviour,
I come to Thee.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
I need Thee every hour;
Stay Thou nearby;
Temptations lose their pow'r
When Thou art nigh.
I need Thee, O I need Thee;
Every hour I need Thee;
O bless me now, my Saviour,
I come to Thee.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
I need Thee every hour
In joy or pain;
Come quickly and abide
Or life is vain.
I need Thee, O I need Thee;
Every hour I need Thee;
O bless me now, my Saviour,
I come to Thee.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
I need Thee every hour,
Most Holy One;
O make me Thine indeed,
Thou blessed Son!
I need Thee, O I need Thee;
Every hour I need Thee;
O bless me now, my Saviour,
I come to Thee.
{end_of_verse}
